# Raw manuscript drops at repo root — clean copies live in assets/publications/.
# Kept untracked so they are never picked up by a broad `git add`.
Bioinformatics.pdf
Proteomics.pdf
Analytical Chemistry.pdf

# Manuscript PDFs themselves are not committed by default: they carry publisher
# "For Peer Review" / confidentiality watermarks and embedded personal emails.
# Remove these two lines (and re-add the files) once you've explicitly approved
# public distribution — see assets/publications/README.md.
assets/publications/*.pdf
